  entryDialoguesLastPassed:
    lastVerdict: 1
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - "Ah, we\u2019ve met before. I appreciate your reasonableness."
    - Good to see a familiar face. Here are my papers again.
    - You passed me last time. I trust today will be just as simple.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - "We\u2019ve already done this once. I assume nothing has changed."
    - You let me through before. I hope good sense still prevails.
    - Back again. I suppose we continue our ritual.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - You let me through before. Perhaps that still means something.
    - "We\u2019ve done this already. Let\u2019s not pretend it matters more now."
    - You passed me once. I wonder what that was worth.
  entryDialoguesLastQuarantined:
    lastVerdict: 2
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - You stopped me before. I trust that was merely caution.
    - "We met already, if you recall. I\u2019m hoping for a fairer judgment today."
    - "You sent me back last time. I\u2019d like to think that was a misunderstanding."
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - You quarantined me before. I assume you had your reasons.
    - I was turned away last time. I hope we can be more rational today.
    - "We\u2019ve already been through this once. Must we repeat it?"
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - "You kept me out before. I\u2019m still here, as you can see."
    - You quarantined me, and yet the world continued collapsing anyway.
    - You sent me away before. I wonder what exactly that protected.
  exitDialoguesPassed:
